<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst James J. Murren said he raised his rating on Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to accumulate from hold.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 33.</p>
</text>
